; compiler-expr-1178-1189-pl-b-01 (#1178 and #1189) - expression matrix:
; open cells, context pl, value set B, 8 cells
; BUG(orig) (#1178): a Quick fetched while the type so far is Long is
; cut to a whole number at once.
; BUG(orig) (#1189): ^ with a negative base drops the sign of the power.
; Correct: the values of the fixed rules of the matrix's model (tools/lib/exprmatrix/
; model.c); the original's values are the declared deviations of the test.
; The cells need the fixes of both issues: after the first fix the port
; neither reproduces the original nor meets the expectation and the test fails;
; the commit of the second fix marks it fixed.
; cells: pl-pow-q-b-B pl-pow-q-w-B pl-pow-q-l-B pl-pow-q-q-B
; cells: pl-pow-q-f-B pl-pow-q-cb-B pl-pow-q-cw-B pl-pow-q-cl-B
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
DEFTYPE .l gl
Statement pl{x.l}
  SHARED gl
  gl=x
End Statement
!TestCase{cells}
  vq.q=-1.5
  nb.b=3 : nw.w=3 : nl.l=3 : nq.q=3 : nf.f=3
  pl{vq ^ nb} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-b-B"}
  pl{vq ^ nw} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-w-B"}
  pl{vq ^ nl} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-l-B"}
  pl{vq ^ nq} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-q-B"}
  pl{vq ^ nf} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-f-B"}
  pl{vq ^ 3} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-cb-B"}
  pl{vq ^ 3} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-cw-B"}
  pl{vq ^ 3} : !CheckEq{gl,-3,"pl-pow-q-cl-B"}
!EndTestCase
